@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber
title Generic GET Flow (Retrieve Data / List Data)\n\nTEMPLATE FOR READ OPERATIONS (single or list)\n \n Method name and attributes must be adjusted

actor User
participant ":UI" as UI

participant ":ControllerRest" as Controller

participant ":EntityMapper" as Mapper
participant "responseDTO:ResponseDTO" as ResponseDTO

participant ":EntityService" as Service

participant ":IEntityRepository" as Repo
participant ":IEntityRepositoryJPA" as RepoJPA

participant ":EntityAssembler" as Assembler
participant "entityDM:EntityDM" as DM

participant "domainEntity:Entity" as Domain

database "DB" as DB


' =========================================================
' 1. USER REQUEST
' =========================================================
User -> UI : Request data (GET /entity or GET /entities)
activate UI

UI -> Controller : GET request (id or filter)
activate Controller


' =========================================================
' 2. SERVICE LAYER (QUERY ORCHESTRATION)
' =========================================================
Controller -> Service : getData(data)
activate Service


' =========================================================
' 3. REPOSITORY QUERY (DB ACCESS)
' =========================================================
Service -> Repo : find(data)
activate Repo

Repo -> RepoJPA : findById() / findAll()
activate RepoJPA

RepoJPA -> DB : SELECT
activate DB
DB --> RepoJPA : data
deactivate DB

RepoJPA --> Repo : entityDM / List<entityDM>
deactivate RepoJPA


' =========================================================
' 4. DM → DOMAIN (ASSEMBLER)
' =========================================================
Repo -> Assembler : toDomain(entityDM or list)
activate Assembler

note right of Assembler
Converts:
- DM → Domain
- Supports single or list
end note

Assembler --> Domain ** : <<create>>
Assembler --> Repo : domainEntity / list<domainEntity>
deactivate Assembler

Repo --> Service : domainEntity / list<domainEntity>
deactivate Repo


' =========================================================
' 5. DOMAIN → DTO (MAPPER)
' =========================================================
Service --> Controller : domainEntity / list<domainEntity>
deactivate Service


Controller -> Mapper : toResponse(domainData)
activate Mapper

note right of Mapper
Converts:
- Domain → ResponseDTO
- Handles single or list mapping
end note

Mapper --> ResponseDTO ** : <<create>>
Mapper --> Controller : responseDTO / list<responseDTO>
deactivate Mapper


' =========================================================
' 6. HATEOAS ENRICHMENT
' =========================================================
Controller -> Controller : addLinks(responseDTO)

note right of Controller
Includes:
- self
- related resources
- navigation links
end note


' =========================================================
' 7. RESPONSE TO USER
' =========================================================
Controller --> UI : ResponseDTO / List<ResponseDTO> + HTTP 200 OK
deactivate Controller

UI --> User : Display data
deactivate UI

@enduml